@startuml
title Digital Credential Presentation part 1 : verification request (SD-JWT VC , OpenID4VP 1.0 , Thai VC ARF 2.0 DRAFT 0)

participant "Verifier Officer" as Officer
participant "<color:#white>Verifier Toolkit</color>" as VSys #6A1B9A
participant "<color:#white>VCVP Core</color>" as Core #3F51B5
participant "<color:#white>one-core (VP Engine)</color>" as VPEngine #chocolate
participant "<color:#white>ETDA Trusted List (CDN)</color>" as Trust #0B2E6B

note right of Officer #wheat:[SPEC] Verifier Officer = staff of the verifier agency using the Verifier Toolkit\nsections 1 to 4 : the officer requests a verification and shows the QR
note right of Core #wheat:[CONDITION] before this flow : the verifier setup is done (VP part 0)\nverifier key and DID , listed in ver.txt , issuer schema imported , verification template created

note over Core,Trust #violet: 0.1 Load ETDA Trusted Lists (when a transaction needs them)
note right of Core #wheat:[SPEC] steps in the ETDA Trusted List Load sequence (first tab)\nVCVP Core also loads ver.txt for its own verifier check in section 2
note right of Core #wheat:[STANDARD] Thai VC ARF 2.0 DRAFT 0\n• appendix 8.2 E.1.1 (MUST)  the verifier fetches iss.txt and wp.txt
note right of Core #wheat:[SPEC] Trusted List not usable (TRUST_LIST_EXPIRED / TRUST_LIST_UNAVAILABLE) : the calling step answers 503 Service Unavailable + Retry-After: 300\nnot the trust failure reason of that step , as in the ETDA Trusted List Load sequence

note over Officer,VSys #khaki: 1. Verifier requests a verification
Officer->VSys: Request verification\ncredential , requested claims ex : LicenseNumber , FullNameTH , purpose

note over VSys,Trust #violet: 2. VCVP Core validates the verifier before creating a proof request
VSys->Core: Create verification + Consumer-Key + Token | POST /api/proof-request/v1 (VCVP Core 24)\nverification_template_id , verifier_identity_id , purpose (code , legal_basis , consent_ref optional) , callback_url (optional)
Core->Core: Check Consumer-Key and Token , validate caller authorization\nCheck Purpose.Code is in the Purpose.Code list and callback_url (when sent) is https , otherwise 400 FailureReason = REQUEST_REJECTED
note right of Core #wheat:[STANDARD] PDPA B.E. 2562\n• section 19  consent is obtained before or at the time of collection
note right of Core #wheat:[SPEC] the holder gives consent in the wallet when presenting (VP part 2 , section 4) , DW keeps the sharing record\nConsentRef = optional reference of a consent the verifier agency keeps itself , stored when sent , not checked
note right of Core #wheat:[STANDARD] RFC 9110\n• 15.5.2 (MUST)  401 when the request has no valid credentials , with WWW-Authenticate\n• 15.5.4  403 when the caller is known but not allowed
Core->Core: Resolve the verification template (VerificationTemplates) , not found 403 FailureReason = TEMPLATE_NOT_FOUND\nand the verifier identity (VerifierIdentityId) with its ACTIVE key , not found 403 FailureReason = VERIFIER_DID_NOT_FOUND\nboth of the caller organisation , another organisation 403 FailureReason = CALLER_NOT_AUTHORIZED
note right of Core #wheat:[STANDARD] Thai VC ARF 2.0 DRAFT 0\n• 9.8 (MUST)  identity , key , status , validity period and scope checked from the Trusted List\n• 12.2.1 (MUST)  the verifier entry is in the Trusted List\n• 8.4.1 step 3 (MUST)  verifier service found by ServiceTypeIdentifier and key , organisation and service status active
note right of Core #wheat:[SPEC] service type = verifier , organisation and service status = active , validity period current , the verifier public key is listed , purpose within the allowed purposes\nThis check before creating a request is a VCVP policy , the wallet checks the verifier itself (VP part 2 , section 1.2 , TC-1)
Core->Core: Look up the verifier in the cached Verifier Trusted List (ver.txt , ETDA Trusted List Load)\nservice type = verifier (ServiceTypeIdentifier) , verifier DID and key listed , organisation and service status = active , validity period current , purpose allowed
note right of Core #wheat:[AUDIT LOG] VCVPAuditLog (TrustCheck)\nresult stored in TrustCheck.Result , timestamp in TrustCheck.CheckedAt\nTrusted List reference (LoTESequenceNumber , entity id) in TrustCheck.RegistryReference

alt Consumer-Key or Token invalid or missing
    Core->Core: [ERROR AUDIT] Write audit record of VCVP Core 24 (FailureReason = CALLER_NOT_AUTHENTICATED , OrgCode and Actor empty)
    VSys<--Core: 401 + WWW-Authenticate | failure_reason = CALLER_NOT_AUTHENTICATED
    Officer<--VSys: Show error , verification not created
else Purpose.Code not in the Purpose.Code list or callback_url not https
    Core->Core: [ERROR AUDIT] Write audit record of VCVP Core 24 (FailureReason = REQUEST_REJECTED)
    VSys<--Core: 400 | failure_reason = REQUEST_REJECTED
    Officer<--VSys: Show error , verification not created
else Template or verifier identity not found , verifier not authorized or not in the Verifier Trusted List
    note over Core #pink: Request rejected before creating a proof request
    Core->Core: [ERROR AUDIT] Write audit record of VCVP Core 24\n(FailureReason = TEMPLATE_NOT_FOUND / CALLER_NOT_AUTHORIZED / VERIFIER_DID_NOT_FOUND / VERIFIER_NOT_TRUSTED , TrustCheck)
    VSys<--Core: 403 | failure_reason = TEMPLATE_NOT_FOUND / CALLER_NOT_AUTHORIZED / VERIFIER_DID_NOT_FOUND / VERIFIER_NOT_TRUSTED
    Officer<--VSys: Reject request\nUnauthorized / Not trusted / Insufficient permission
else Trusted List not usable
    Core->Core: [ERROR AUDIT] Write audit record of VCVP Core 24 (FailureReason = TRUST_LIST_EXPIRED / TRUST_LIST_UNAVAILABLE)
    VSys<--Core: 503 + Retry-After | failure_reason = TRUST_LIST_EXPIRED / TRUST_LIST_UNAVAILABLE
    Officer<--VSys: Show error , try again later
else Verifier authorized and trusted

    note over Core,VPEngine #orange: 3. VCVP Core creates the proof request
    note right of Core #wheat:[SPEC] webhookDestinationUrl is sent on every request , the engine calls VCVP Core 30 when the result is ready\nthen VCVP Core calls Verifications.CallbackUrl when it has a value , null : the Verifier Toolkit asks for the result at VCVP Core 32 (VP part 2 , section 9)\nVCVP policy : a new random secret for each request , VCVP Core keeps only its hash
    Core->Core: Create the webhook secret (32 random bytes)\nwebhookDestinationUrl = URL of VCVP Core 30 + ?webhook_token={secret}
    Core->VPEngine: Create verification request | POST /api/proof-request/v1\nproofSchemaId , protocol , verifier , verifierKey , webhookDestinationUrl
    VPEngine-->Core: { id } = VerificationId (state CREATED)
    note right of Core #wheat:[STANDARD] PDPA B.E. 2562\n• section 39  record of processing activities , including the purpose
    note right of Core #wheat:[SPEC] purpose and legal basis are recorded when the request is created and cannot be added later
    Core->Core: [DATA STORE] Store Verifications table\nVerificationId = id from the engine , Purpose (Code , LegalBasis , ConsentRef when sent) , WebhookSecretHash (sha256 of the secret) , CallbackUrl (callback_url , null when not sent) , Status = PENDING
    Core->Core: [AUDIT LOG] Write audit record of VCVP Core 24 : who requested which verification and for which purpose\n(Purpose.Code , Purpose.LegalBasis , Purpose.ConsentRef , TrustCheck , EngineCalls , Correlation.VerificationId)
    VSys<--Core: 200 | verification_id
end

note over VSys,VPEngine #orange: 4. Generate the verification link
VSys->Core: Request verification link + Consumer-Key + Token | POST /api/proof-request/v1/{verification_id}/share (VCVP Core 25)
Core->Core: Check Consumer-Key and Token , validate caller authorization
alt Consumer-Key or Token invalid or missing
    Core->Core: [ERROR AUDIT] Write audit record of VCVP Core 25 (FailureReason = CALLER_NOT_AUTHENTICATED , OrgCode and Actor empty)
    VSys<--Core: 401 + WWW-Authenticate | failure_reason = CALLER_NOT_AUTHENTICATED
    Officer<--VSys: Show error , no verification link
else Caller not authorized
    Core->Core: [ERROR AUDIT] Write audit record of VCVP Core 25 (FailureReason = CALLER_NOT_AUTHORIZED)
    VSys<--Core: 403 | failure_reason = CALLER_NOT_AUTHORIZED
    Officer<--VSys: Show error , no verification link
else Caller authorized
    Core->Core: Find VerificationId in Verifications table , not found 403 FailureReason = VERIFICATION_NOT_FOUND\nanother organisation 403 FailureReason = CALLER_NOT_AUTHORIZED
    note right of Core #wheat:[STANDARD] OpenID4VP 1.0\n• 5.9.3 (MUST)  decentralized_identifier , the request object is signed with a key of the verifier DID
    note right of Core #wheat:[STANDARD] Thai VC ARF 2.0 DRAFT 0\n• appendix 8.2 E.1.5 (MUST)  TC-1 , the wallet finds the verifier public key in the Verifier Trusted List\n• 8.1.2 (MUST)  client identifier prefix from OpenID4VP , decentralized_identifier allowed\n• 12.7  x509_san_dns listed for verifiers in the Trusted List\n• chapter 14 SC-09  the wallet enforces the client_id prefix\n• 12.2.1 (MUST NOT)  no redirect_uri client_id without a DID
    note right of Core #wheat:[SPEC] verifier trust comes from ver.txt , not from a verifier attestation signed by the engine itself
    note right of VPEngine #wheat:[ENGINE RULE] share works only when the state is CREATED , PENDING or INTERACTION_EXPIRED , other states get 400 BR_0013\na new share replaces the interaction , the previous link stops working
    Core->VPEngine: Generate verification link | POST /api/proof-request/v1/{id}/share\nbody { "params" : { "clientIdScheme" : "decentralized_identifier" } }
    alt Link created
        VPEngine-->Core: url , expiresAt , state
        Core->Core: [DATA STORE] Store OfferUrl + ExpiresAt in Verifications table , Status = PENDING
        Core->Core: [AUDIT LOG] Write audit record of VCVP Core 25 : who created the verification link (EngineCalls , Correlation.VerificationId)
        VSys<--Core: 200 | offer_url , expires_at
        note right of VSys #wheat:[STANDARD] Thai VC ARF 2.0 DRAFT 0\n• appendix 8.2 E.1.2 , E.1.3 , E.1.4  the QR carries request_uri , the wallet fetches the full request object (cross-device)
        Officer<--VSys: Show QR code (cross-device) or deep link (same device)\nthe holder scans the QR next (VP part 2 , section 1)
    else State not CREATED / PENDING / INTERACTION_EXPIRED
        VPEngine-->Core: 400 BR_0013
        Core->Core: [ERROR AUDIT] Write audit record of VCVP Core 25 (FailureReason = VERIFICATION_NOT_SHAREABLE , EngineCalls , Correlation.VerificationId)
        VSys<--Core: 409 | failure_reason = VERIFICATION_NOT_SHAREABLE
        Officer<--VSys: Show error , create a new verification (section 2)
    end
end

@enduml
